@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@token = eyJhbGci... (cole seu token aqui)

### Listar Endereços
GET {{baseUrl}}/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1. Cadastrar Endereço (Captura o ID automaticamente)
# @name criarEndereco
POST {{baseUrl}}/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "Casa",
  "recipientName": "Maria Silva",
  "street": "Rua das Flores",
  "number": "123",
  "complement": "Apto 12",
  "neighborhood": "Centro",
  "city": "Sao Paulo",
  "state": "SP",
  "zipCode": "01001-000",
  "isDefault": true
}

### Capturar a variável do endereço criado
@addressId = {{criarEndereco.response.body.data.id}}

### 2. Buscar Endereço Específico (Usa o ID capturado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/addresses/{{addressId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Atualizar Endereço (Usa o ID capturado)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/addresses/{{addressId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "Trabalho",
  "street": "Avenida Paulista",
  "number": "1000",
  "isDefault": false
}

### 4. Remover Endereço (Usa o ID capturado)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/addresses/{{addressId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}